==Esperanto==
===Adjective===
'''nigra'''
# [[black]].
#: La balsalo plenigis kun belaj virjunuloj vestitaj en '''nigraj''' smokingoj. 
#: ''The ballroom was filled with handsome young men dressed in black tuxedos.''

===Related terms===
*[[nigre]] - [ [[dressed]] ] in black
*[[nigrigi]] - to [[blacken]] (literally and figuratively) 
*[[nigro]] - black (the color itself)

